<!doctype lake><title>退款SOP</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><p data-lake-id="uf5075b6a" id="uf5075b6a"><span data-lake-id="u54662842" id="u54662842">更新日期：2026年5月7日</span></p><p data-lake-id="uccc8452c" id="uccc8452c"><span data-lake-id="ueb9a819a" id="ueb9a819a">退款规则：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub5c0f139" id="ub5c0f139"><span data-lake-id="u4fe7e22a" id="u4fe7e22a">有效期大于等于14天，支持按剩余价值退款</span><span data-lake-id="ubd65da96" id="ubd65da96"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u33cbbc90" id="u33cbbc90">有效期小于14天，支持折半转成按量付费额度</span></p><p data-lake-id="u32fc1834" id="u32fc1834"><span data-lake-id="u2d6e9c3d" id="u2d6e9c3d">正常的退款，统一收20%的手续费，手续费超过100元按100元计</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8fce01a9" id="u8fce01a9"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u056f124b" id="u056f124b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud981b234" id="ud981b234">注意： 常规规则是，尽可能解决用户的问题，留住用户，不走退款。</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u1d17248b" id="u1d17248b"><span data-lake-id="u7a29a4f0" id="u7a29a4f0">**          可以引导用户转按量，永久有效，什么时候想用都可以用。  **</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud73f0f26" id="ud73f0f26"><span data-lake-id="u64471822" id="u64471822">**          实在解决不了的或者用户闹事的，再沟通退款。**</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9fbd8220" id="u9fbd8220"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u428570d8" id="u428570d8"><strong><span data-lake-id="uca555d67" id="uca555d67" style="color: black">1.1</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u34e38dda" id="u34e38dda">询问退款原因</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4a61df77" id="u4a61df77"><span data-lake-id="u29314553" id="u29314553">话术：</span><em><span data-lake-id="ueea27341" id="ueea27341" style="color: #2f4bda">您是什么原因要退款呢？</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u391bb65c" id="u391bb65c"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u02e4cf19" id="u02e4cf19"><span data-lake-id="ubd835b87" id="ubd835b87">注意：如果是用户使用问题，先发群里，确认是否可以帮用户解决；</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20%20%20%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%8B%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E8%83%BD%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E9%80%80%E6%AC%BE%E4%BA%86%EF%BC%9B%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22PtYi4%22%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="uc492bdff" id="uc492bdff"><span data-lake-id="u9c8c27f3" id="u9c8c27f3"> 注意：订阅的，可以引导用户按照50%规则转按量；</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E6%8C%89%E9%87%8F%E6%B0%B8%E4%B9%85%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%9A%82%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%A8%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%85%88%E7%95%99%E7%9D%80%EF%BC%8C%E9%9A%8F%E6%97%B6%E6%83%B3%E7%94%A8%E9%83%BD%E8%83%BD%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22EPwuf%22%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u3ab61769" id="u3ab61769"><span data-lake-id="u85ba8d1d" id="u85ba8d1d">注意：退款原因要记录到周报；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud5cbdbbd" id="ud5cbdbbd"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ue02c0c1d" id="ue02c0c1d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u65eba8b9" id="u65eba8b9" style="color: black">1.2</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ue7c1d6e7" id="ue7c1d6e7">提交退款材料</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u177c63ab" id="u177c63ab"><span data-lake-id="ua9f19056" id="ua9f19056">确认用户退款，发话术给用户；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucb57f1cf" id="ucb57f1cf"><span data-lake-id="u07852c51" id="u07852c51">话术如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2b30767c" id="u2b30767c"><em><span data-lake-id="u98a0856b" id="u98a0856b" style="color: #2f4bda">这样，您给我 </span></em><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u2789f07e" id="u2789f07e" style="color: #2f4bda">1. 网站注册账号 </span></strong></em><em><span data-lake-id="udd0f21f6" id="udd0f21f6" style="color: #2f4bda">2. 订阅的付款截图（需要能看到日期） </span></em><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u9d5ae8c4" id="u9d5ae8c4" style="color: #2f4bda">3.仪表盘截图：</span></strong></em><a href="https://www.aicodemirror.com/dashboard" target="_blank" data-lake-id="uf66bd0c0" id="uf66bd0c0"><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u22cd13a9" id="u22cd13a9" style="color: #2f4bda">https://www.aicodemirror.com/dashboard</span></strong></em></a><em><span data-lake-id="u83ecb898" id="u83ecb898" style="color: #2f4bda"> 4.邀请返利截图：</span></em><a href="https://www.aicodemirror.com/dashboard/invite-rewards" target="_blank" data-lake-id="uc47e3249" id="uc47e3249"><em><span data-lake-id="u5c3621e5" id="u5c3621e5" style="color: #2f4bda">https://www.aicodemirror.com/dashboard/invite-rewards</span></em></a><em><span data-lake-id="u9c9f86ae" id="u9c9f86ae" style="color: #2f4bda">  </span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u0c929aec" id="u0c929aec"><em><span data-lake-id="u688ed3d7" id="u688ed3d7" style="color: #2f4bda">5、您的开票抬头或者邮箱</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u9363c12f" id="u9363c12f"><em><span data-lake-id="u207e7fc8" id="u207e7fc8" style="color: #2f4bda">我们将根据您的用量情况，核算退款金额，请您稍等。退款后会注销账号请您知悉。账号注销后将永久冻结，不能再注册使用。</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="uf387e8ee" id="uf387e8ee"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u4e68e920" id="u4e68e920"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e4b858c" id="u0e4b858c" style="color: black">1.3</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ub29f0d87" id="ub29f0d87">核算退款金额</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue1d5eb15" id="ue1d5eb15"><span data-lake-id="ue03e94e4" id="ue03e94e4">多选聊天记录，转发大群，简要说明退款原因；请杰哥确认；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2b2d3dbe" id="u2b2d3dbe"><span data-lake-id="ueddf190e" id="ueddf190e">确认后，核算退款金额；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9dbccf14" id="u9dbccf14"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uc671043a" id="uc671043a"><span data-lake-id="u1a871d0d" id="u1a871d0d">退款计算方式：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc443a9a8" id="uc443a9a8"><span data-lake-id="u0638d8af" id="u0638d8af"> (余额-邀请返利) x 充值折扣 - 支付金额</span><em><span data-lake-id="u8f4a22b2" id="u8f4a22b2">0.6%手续费  - 充值金额</span></em><span data-lake-id="ub3581c37" id="ub3581c37">20%手续费（退款手续费封顶100）=应退金额       </span></p><p data-lake-id="u5335ea8f" id="u5335ea8f"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ue5e208f8" id="ue5e208f8"><span data-lake-id="u7a719a7e" id="u7a719a7e"> 正常的退款，扣除充值金额*0.6%的支付手续费</span></p><p data-lake-id="u37258c73" id="u37258c73"><span data-lake-id="ucfd5dcb1" id="ucfd5dcb1">然后找主管核对，邀请返利扣除方式。</span></p><ol list="u575c583f"><li data-lake-id="uba12aaae" id="uba12aaae"><span data-lake-id="u36fbaac8" id="u36fbaac8">扣除邀请人的邀请奖励积分（邀请奖励账户余额） -&gt; 扣除邀请人的奖励积分（按量付费余额）-&gt; 扣除被邀请人的  </span></li></ol><ol list="u19019346" start="2"><li data-lake-id="u20fa6352" id="u20fa6352"><span data-lake-id="u8d9a5464" id="u8d9a5464">如果要扣被邀请人的，退款金额在100以内不要扣  </span></li></ol><ol list="ud6d4d575" start="3"><li data-lake-id="uafe27a8c" id="uafe27a8c"><span data-lake-id="u39a3cd12" id="u39a3cd12">如果用户反应大，就不扣</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="u1aecf4a6" id="u1aecf4a6"><span data-lake-id="u0d4ea926" id="u0d4ea926">如果需要扣除该用户的，按照充值金额*20%扣除，最高扣除100. </span></p><p data-lake-id="u5ddc0964" id="u5ddc0964"><span data-lake-id="udcad1417" id="udcad1417"> 如果用户本身有邀请返利也需要扣除（计算转入钱包的金额，如果没有转入则不计算）</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue506e1ce" id="ue506e1ce"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ue5ab07f6" id="ue5ab07f6"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u509a158c" id="u509a158c"><span data-lake-id="uf518b29c" id="uf518b29c">示例如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud1a81052" id="ud1a81052"><em><span data-lake-id="uc397fda9" id="uc397fda9" style="color: #2f4bda">按照用户概览页面余额来计算：</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="uf2b34d2c" id="uf2b34d2c"><em><span data-lake-id="u6aebf970" id="u6aebf970" style="color: #2f4bda">比如</span></em><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u09890bfc" id="u09890bfc" style="color: #2f4bda">ultra</span></strong></em><em><span data-lake-id="u6169ac8c" id="u6169ac8c" style="color: #2f4bda">用户</span></em><em><strong><span data-lake-id="ud4492f21" id="ud4492f21" style="color: #2f4bda">余额为</span></strong></em><em><span data-lake-id="u65d3203c" id="u65d3203c" style="color: #2f4bda"> 1000</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u7e96ad74" id="u7e96ad74">__</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u11f0f3ac" id="u11f0f3ac" style="color: #2f4bda">，参与邀请返利</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="uf8569f1f" id="uf8569f1f"><em><span data-lake-id="u8973d967" id="u8973d967" style="color: #2f4bda">退款金额为（1000-邀请返利）</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u85ade85a" id="u85ade85a" style="color: #2f4bda">0.75-支付手续费=750-1259</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ud23c78f6" id="ud23c78f6" style="color: #2f4bda">0.2=498.2</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u6728a6e0" id="u6728a6e0"><em><span data-lake-id="ua63cc2d3" id="ua63cc2d3" style="color: #2f4bda">注意：邀请返利有就扣除，没有则不扣除</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="uf7d41317" id="uf7d41317"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uf1cfa18b" id="uf1cfa18b"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ub0bd8b0c" id="ub0bd8b0c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb78547b" id="ubb78547b" style="color: black">1.4</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u385d0d6d" id="u385d0d6d">检查作废发票</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub54ec3df" id="ub54ec3df"><span data-lake-id="u9c494e57" id="u9c494e57">检查用户是否有发票需要作废；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u07d83080" id="u07d83080"><span data-lake-id="ude6e82cf" id="ude6e82cf">作废后，按照实际使用金额，重新登记开票；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u21b80ddc" id="u21b80ddc"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ua1e5bb00" id="ua1e5bb00"><span data-lake-id="u068fe53f" id="u068fe53f">您好，麻烦您告诉我下您的开票信息：抬头，收发票的邮箱哈</span></p><p data-lake-id="u506d18ab" id="u506d18ab"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u2559518d" id="u2559518d"><span data-lake-id="u488608db" id="u488608db">  不要直接问是否开过发票。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf3b93f59" id="uf3b93f59"><span data-lake-id="u9da51293" id="u9da51293">拿到开票信息后查询系统开票情况，再告知用户，会作废并根据退款情况重新开具。    </span></p><p data-lake-id="u4816998a" id="u4816998a"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u4cde1441" id="u4cde1441"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6cc16371" id="u6cc16371" style="color: black">1.5</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d305858" id="u0d305858">登记周报退款</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u130fbaef" id="u130fbaef"><span data-lake-id="ub909a3c6" id="ub909a3c6">登记退款记录到周报，截图示例如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uba2591b4" id="uba2591b4"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1770882309717-ab48e366-7ea9-44af-a94e-ee7ecb5e4b2d.png%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22MDrbh%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4f0e881f" id="u4f0e881f"><span data-lake-id="u3427e633" id="u3427e633">用户确认后，请用户添加阿飞企业微信退款</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9f0e9666" id="u9f0e9666"><span data-lake-id="u97829c78" id="u97829c78">话术如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ufa31c772" id="ufa31c772"><span data-lake-id="ue9f8d76c" id="ue9f8d76c"> </span><em><span data-lake-id="u01876290" id="u01876290" style="color: #2f4bda">确认金额无误后请加企业微信，为您返款。</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u0faa8bac" id="u0faa8bac"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fjpeg%2F523194%2F1778909325863-afeed556-fc02-4d18-97d4-eb1fbc6b7d6e.jpeg%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22yqgsJ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0d8e1bd4" id="u0d8e1bd4"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ub5846989" id="ub5846989"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uc2aeab2c" id="uc2aeab2c"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u680dd455" id="u680dd455"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uee01a29e" id="uee01a29e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3a57075" id="ua3a57075" style="color: black">1.6</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u8869bcc5" id="u8869bcc5">提交阿滨打款</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc65445e6" id="uc65445e6"><span data-lake-id="ud8cd31cc" id="ud8cd31cc">请用户提交注册手机号，检查周报，确认退款金额，给用户打款；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua5ae8337" id="ua5ae8337"><span data-lake-id="uf8e89cf6" id="uf8e89cf6">打款完毕，更新周报记录；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u32c9a987" id="u32c9a987"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1770882325630-917f2452-3f1b-4d6b-b5f3-35aa6616df02.png%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22a0I23%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9b366dfb" id="u9b366dfb"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u0a20fb2c" id="u0a20fb2c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1deb96bd" id="u1deb96bd" style="color: black">1.7</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u736c75ec" id="u736c75ec">退款完毕，提交阿飞注销账号</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u8c867f88" id="u8c867f88"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ue91e4c6b" id="ue91e4c6b"><span data-lake-id="u6e14a6de" id="u6e14a6de">客服88888群，提交注销账号；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u32808e50" id="u32808e50"><span data-lake-id="u9118852d" id="u9118852d">话术：</span><em><span data-lake-id="ub611b188" id="ub611b188" style="color: #2f4bda">15810032255  退款完毕，请注销账号。</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="uc53235d3" id="uc53235d3"><span data-lake-id="uf5563734" id="uf5563734">__</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc6f92570" id="uc6f92570"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1770882388716-30a6a65e-9936-47d3-9354-ed2f49ef745b.png%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22eUNc1%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u530686e5" id="u530686e5"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u77616312" id="u77616312"><span data-lake-id="u2a2344fe" id="u2a2344fe">注销账号操作：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4a638eff" id="u4a638eff"><span data-lake-id="ua4673f45" id="ua4673f45">打开</span><a href="https://admin.aicodemirror.com/anthropic/management" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u2cefdaa5" id="u2cefdaa5"><span data-lake-id="ud6065b92" id="ud6065b92">https://admin.aicodemirror.com/anthropic/management</span></a></p><p data-lake-id="ub54d978a" id="ub54d978a"><span data-lake-id="u00c94b1d" id="u00c94b1d">step1：登录管理后台，【用户管理】页面输入用户手机号</span></p><p data-lake-id="u824e6108" id="u824e6108"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1778909459116-e9497ff6-42d4-4d40-98ed-383371349a72.png%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22XWb6i%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2cbc64ac" id="u2cbc64ac"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u44390234" id="u44390234"><span data-lake-id="ud56def2a" id="ud56def2a">step2： 冻结账号</span></p><p data-lake-id="uce845541" id="uce845541"><span data-lake-id="uaed35cf8" id="uaed35cf8">查询到用户后，先冻结账号。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc4a87dd6" id="uc4a87dd6"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1778909498739-c9451741-87f8-4f4a-834b-02cceefe7425.png%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22DpHlo%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u52f7be0c" id="u52f7be0c"><span data-lake-id="u9f74eaeb" id="u9f74eaeb">step3：删除账号</span></p><p data-lake-id="u65a4688d" id="u65a4688d"><span data-lake-id="u469ff3ce" id="u469ff3ce">选择删除账号，并在弹出提示确定</span></p><p data-lake-id="u55c7046d" id="u55c7046d"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1778909521534-c20ce23f-44b6-4f91-b845-ad3152776d93.png%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22v43vL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucfb823ae" id="ucfb823ae"><span data-lake-id="u0dd87ca4" id="u0dd87ca4">step4：重新输入用户手机号，查询确认（没有找到匹配的用户），注销成功。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u604ff653" id="u604ff653"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1778909542132-cd6bf073-13cc-4f23-b200-6a8d4a56f141.png%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22p0164%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u96ec7b89" id="u96ec7b89"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u5b738c0c" id="u5b738c0c"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ue68875e3" id="ue68875e3"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ucb53b508" id="ucb53b508"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2dcd0d22" id="u2dcd0d22" style="color: black">1.8</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ude102b1d" id="ude102b1d">汇总退款金额，找张总报销</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u456a5138" id="u456a5138"><span data-lake-id="u852559af" id="u852559af">按照周或者累计金额，核算总退款金额，找张总报销。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8cef2848" id="u8cef2848"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u93299393" id="u93299393"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua167cd6a" id="ua167cd6a" style="color: black">1.9</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ueeabcbb2" id="ueeabcbb2">按周为单位 分析优化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ua1f66574" id="ua1f66574"><span data-lake-id="uc5cb282c" id="uc5cb282c">1、分析本周退款条数和原因，复盘沟通过程；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3bcdc1f6" id="u3bcdc1f6"><span data-lake-id="u4819f49e" id="u4819f49e">2、明确用户退款根本原因和诉求，寻求对应优化方案，降低后续该原因退款。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc928de43" id="uc928de43"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u73aa7a6b" id="u73aa7a6b"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u2d4960ec" id="u2d4960ec"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3a49518b" id="u3a49518b" style="color: black">1.10</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u8c804fcb" id="u8c804fcb">check list</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue7d4dae6" id="ue7d4dae6"><span data-lake-id="uc3f36934" id="uc3f36934">1、确认退款金额计算无误</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9235161b" id="u9235161b"><span data-lake-id="u622d1bc2" id="u622d1bc2">2、确认已登记的发票作废完成</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud5a4e5de" id="ud5a4e5de"><span data-lake-id="ud1c929a8" id="ud1c929a8">3、确认账号注销</span></p>